    "Hoodrich gang definitions. Edited here, reloaded on script start (Insert reloads SHVDN).",
    "",
    "id                 stable key used in save files; never change it once you have a save",
    "tag                4-character label drawn on the wheel",
    "relationshipGroup  vanilla ped relationship group. Membership is detected by THIS, not by",
    "                   ped model, so every gang ped the game spawns is recognised.",
    "colour             [r,g,b] used for the wheel tint and the gang panel",
    "rivals             gang ids this gang is at war with. Dealing on a rival's turf gets you",
    "                   jumped, and their supply contact will not deal with you at all.",
    "turf               GET_NAME_OF_ZONE codes this gang claims. Every code below is a real",
    "                   zone from the game's own popzone table, so they all match something.",
    "joinRespect        respect needed before they will take you on",
    "",
    "To retune territory: stand somewhere in game, open the wheel, Turf > Log zone. The exact",
    "code is shown on screen and written to scripts\\Hoodrich.log. Turf > Dossier dumps the",
    "whole current map. Zones not listed here are neutral ground."
